  "identity_and_exclusions": "Group holdings at issuer level, retain all historical classes in the roster, and reconcile issuer CIK and exchange-listed U.S. common stock class to dated SEC covers. Exclude CIKs from either prior cohort. Prefer Class A among multiple eligible classes, otherwise the smallest original ISIN. Membership is fixed from the historical filing.",
