  "pre_window_qualification": "Require two original issuer earnings disclosures during calendar 2024 with directly stated consolidated USD full-fiscal-year revenue bounds or points for the same fiscal period and accounting scope. Include reaffirmations. Match original publication or conservative filing timestamps and verify historical identity. Selection is independent of revision sign.",
  "development_event_rule": "Enumerate original SEC Item 2.02 filings and reconcile original issuer releases before assessing price availability. Dedupe economic events. Use latest active independently dated comparable same-period guidance preceding the reported update and require both inputs strictly before scheduled open minus 15 minutes. Use same scope and units, and account for intervening guidance, corporate actions and venue changes. Outside-window amendments can clarify original filings without backdating new guidance.",
  "pilot_rule": "Review all issuers classified Software or IT Services in the audited holdings. For each, attempt one readily verifiable same-period quarterly revision in April through June 2025, extending through September as needed. Attempt source support independently of official-opening access. This targeted review supplies a feasibility check.",
  "opening_rule": "For a historically verified Nasdaq security request first-minute historical SIP trades on the matched reaction session. Require a unique uncorrected Q condition on venue Q and tape C using the historical symbol. Use fixed time interval and complete response, abstain if ambiguous or truncated. Preserve only disposition and counts.",
  "planning_floors": {
    "clean_held_pairs": 40,
    "issuers": 15,
    "sessions": 20,
    "held_blocks_with_minimum": 2,
    "minimum_pairs_per_held_block": 10,
    "revision_variation": "Require both signs and count unchanged midpoints separately before scoping a performance test."
  },
